BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🌕 Facing yourself in the mirror
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
DTSTAMP:20260929T213647Z
UID:92b4b787ccb44e4b6003307c@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:This Full Moon lands right on your Sun and Mercury\, lighting 
 up who you are versus what you've built with others (house 7). Add transit
 ing Neptune touching that same spot\, and things may feel blurry: are you 
 seeing yourself clearly\, or through someone else's expectations? Mars\, r
